direction_7 = location "Bandicoot" about "Bandicoot\nA rodent which grew abnormally by feeding on corpses of evil races in the War with Pathos." found "Inhabits Seashore of Hope" at 632 465 in zone 21

On offer
    Say "I'm sorry to ask you for another request. But could you help us one more time?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Recently, Bandicoots have increased in their population and are ruining our precious crops. Help us catch 5 Bandicoots."

